Commit complete day artifacts with one verified receipt

Overlap verified F40 publication with fresh day-pack publication. A fresh owned target becomes reusable only after both artifact hashes pass and one completion receipt is written. Preserve atomic replacement for an existing standalone pack; release both daily file caches in long runs. Validation: 30 related tests and the transport-failure regression passed.


